From 21bfa95709f34b78e73b289cd6d4604dec4e23b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rozeraf <136557397+rozeraf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:11:42 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(plugins): add noctalia.openPanel and slide attached
 panels to a new anchor

Opening an attached panel that is already open from another point of the
same bar slides it there through layer-shell margins instead of destroying
and recreating the surface, so a bar widget can make its dropdown follow
the hovered item without flicker.
